SUMMARY:2816 - Asian Dumplings 101
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting Class with Chef Instructor Joseph Renfroe! Learn the art of making delicious\, handmade dumplings from scratch\, including a variety of fillings and dipping sauces. He will guide you through techniques for perfect folding\, steaming\, and frying\, giving you the skills to recreate these tasty pockets of deliciousness at home. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nJapanese Gyoza\nWonton soup\nCrab rangoon\nDipping sauces
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2816-asian-dumplings-101/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,International Cuisine
