SUMMARY:2817 - Halloween Garden Focaccia and Tiramisu
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate spooky season in the kitchen with Chef Instructor Sophia Dickmyer! In this fun\, hands-on baking class\, you’ll learn the techniques for creating beautifully decorated Halloween-inspired focaccia and a rich\, creamy homemade tiramisu. Whether you’re looking to impress at your next fall gathering or simply enjoy an evening of seasonal baking\, you’ll leave with delicious recipes and new skills to recreate at home. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. Vegetarian. \n\nFocaccia From Scratch\nLots of Fall Veggies and Knife Skills\nPumpkin Homemade Tiramisu\n\n 
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2817-halloween-garden-focaccia-and-tiramisu/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Festive,Let's Bake,Seasonal
