SUMMARY:2818 - Monster Mash: Family Halloween Costume Party
DESCRIPTION:Put on your favorite costume and join Chef Instructor Sophia Dickmyer for a frightfully fun family cooking adventure! Working together\, parents and children will create festive Halloween treats while learning simple kitchen skills and making unforgettable memories. From spooky savory bites to creepy-cute desserts\, this hands-on class is the perfect way to celebrate the season with creativity\, laughter\, and delicious fun. Costumes are encouraged! \nHands on. Ages 7 and up. Tickets are priced per person.  \n\nPumpkin-Shaped Pizza Bombs\nHallowieners\nRice Krispie Brains\nVampire Cookies
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2818-monster-mash-family-halloween-costume-party/
