SUMMARY:2819 - Cast Iron Cooking: Fall Favorites
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the cozy flavors of fall with this hands-on cast iron cooking class led by Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya. You will learn how to make a hearty\, seasonal meal from start to finish – mastering cast iron techniques that bring out bold flavor\, beautiful texture\, and rustic charm. From golden cornbread to tender braised mains and warm\, spiced dessert\, this class is perfect for anyone who loves the comforting side of fall cooking. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nCast Iron Skillet Cornbread with Whipped Maple Butter\nApple Cider-Braised Chicken Thighs with Root Vegetables\nCrispy Brussels Sprouts with Bacon and Balsamic Glaze\nCast Iron Apple Cinnamon Rolls with Maple Cream Cheese Glaze
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2819-cast-iron-cooking-fall-favorites/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Festive,Healthy Eating,Seasonal
