SUMMARY:2820 - Autumn Reserve: Duck at a Steakhouse
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Instructor Joe Hall for an elevated evening of seasonal cooking as you explore techniques used in fine dining kitchens. In this hands-on class\, you’ll build confidence preparing an elegant multi-course meal while learning professional methods\, plating tips\, and flavor pairings that showcase the best of autumn.  \nHands on. Ages 21 and up. Gluten Free \n\nSous Vide Duck Breast\, Reverse Seared\nHerb-Roasted Fingerling Potatoes with Bacon Marmalade\nPoached Pear & Gorgonzola Salad with Candied Nuts and Mulled Cider Vinaigrette\nWarm Local Autumn Sangria
