SUMMARY:2821 - Dutch Oven Dinners
DESCRIPTION:Discover the versatility of the Dutch oven with Chef Instructor Sophia Dickmyer in this hands-on cooking class! You’ll learn essential techniques for creating flavorful\, comforting meals using one of the most dependable tools in the kitchen. From building layers of flavor to mastering braising\, roasting\, and simmering\, you’ll gain the confidence to prepare hearty\, homemade dinners that are perfect for weeknight meals or entertaining family and friends. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nTuscan Braised Chicken Thighs\nChicken And Dumplings\nApple Cinnamon Clafloutis
