SUMMARY:2822 - Holiday Hors D'oeuvres
DESCRIPTION:Elevate your entertaining game with a hands-on class led by Chef Sophia Dickmyer. Together\, you’ll create a lineup of stylish small bites that are perfect for gatherings – easy to make\, beautiful to present\, and full of flavor. Whether you’re hosting a party or looking to add something special to your table\, these appetizers are designed to impress without the stress. \nHands on. Ages 21 and up. \n\nFrench Onion Dip Cups\nSpinach & Artichoke Stuffed Mushrooms\nSavory Cheese Wheelettes\nMini Buttermilk Biscuits\nCranberry Rosemary Spritz
