SUMMARY:2823 - Pennsylvania Dutch Baking Traditions
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich baking traditions of Pennsylvania Dutch country with Chef Instructor Dorothy Weber! In this hands-on class\, you’ll learn time-honored techniques and cherished recipes that have been passed down through generations. Whether you’re new to baking or looking to expand your skills\, you’ll leave with the confidence to recreate these comforting homemade favorites and bring a taste of Lancaster County into your own kitchen. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. Vegetarian \n\nApple Dumplings\nShoofly Pie\nPumpkin Spice Whoopie Pies
