SUMMARY:2824 - Ramen From Scratch
DESCRIPTION:Join Helen Chudakova-Sanya as she demystifies the art of crafting authentic ramen\n from scratch. From making ramen dough and making noodles to simmering a rich broth\, this hands-on experience will immerse you in the soul-warming world of Japanese comfort food. Customize your bowl with an array of toppings and savor the satisfaction of creating a steaming bowl of ramen goodness.\n Hands on. Ages 16 and up. \n  \n\n Ramen Noodles from Scratch\n Miso Ramen Dashi\nThe Perfect Soy Sauce Marinated Egg
