DESCRIPTION:Whether you are a seasoned home chef or a culinary adventurer\, our Paella Cooking Class promises a taste of Spain that will linger in your memory. Come join Chef Joseph Renfroe for a feast that captures the essence of Spanish hospitality and the joy of creating a culinary masterpiece.\n Hands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nPaella Valenciana\nPaella de Marisco\nCroquetas de Jamon: Serrano Ham Fritters\nChurros with Classic Chocolate Sauce
