DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with an elegant evening of cooking\, great food\, and festive flavors! Join Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya for a hands-on culinary experience where you’ll master the art of sous vide cooking while preparing a restaurant-worthy dinner perfect for sharing with someone special. Enjoy an evening filled with delicious food\, new techniques\, and holiday cheer in our welcoming kitchen. \nHands on. Ages 18 and up.  \n\nSous Vide New York Strip with Red Wine Pan Sauce\nCreamy Wild Mushroom Risotto\nMaple Dijon Roasted Brussels Sprouts with Crispy Bacon\nWarm Gingerbread Bread Pudding with Salted Caramel
