SUMMARY:2835 - Thanksgiving Make & Take Bounty
DESCRIPTION:Take the stress out of Thanksgiving and let us help you prepare a delicious homemade holiday meal! In this hands-on Make & Take class\, Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya will guide you through creating a complete Thanksgiving dinner for four\, ready to package and take home. You’ll learn practical techniques\, enjoy a fun afternoon in the kitchen\, and leave with everything you need for a memorable holiday meal. No grocery shopping\, no hours of meal prep\, and no mountain of dishes waiting for you at home. Just reheat\, serve\, and enjoy more time with family and friends. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nApple Cider Braised Turkey Legs and Chicken Thighs\nCreamy Garlic Mashed Potatoes\nHerb Turkey Gravy\nMaple Brown Sugar Roasted Sweet Potatoes\nGreen Bean Casserole with Crispy Onions\nCranberry Orange Sauce\nPumpkin Dump Cake
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2835-thanksgiving-make-take-feast/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festive,Seasonal,Special Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thanksgiving-feast-e1787175259522.jpg
