SUMMARY:2836 - Parent and Child: Fresh Gingerbread House Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive hands-on workshop where parents and children can create their very own gingerbread houses! Using homemade gingerbread pieces\, Chef Joseph Renfroe will guide you step by step through assembly and decorating\, while sharing creative tips and techniques to make each house uniquely magical. This fun holiday activity is the perfect way to build sweet memories together. \nHands on. 1 project per parent and child. Ages 5 and up.\n  Ticket price is per 1 parent and 1 child. \n\nWork with homemade gingerbread house kits and learn how to make one\nAssemble your gingerbread house from start to finish\nLearn decorating tips and techniques with colorful candies and royal icing\nEnjoy a cup of hot chocolate and freshly made cookies while you create
