SUMMARY:2837 - Elegant Cookie Decorating Extravaganza
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for our Cookie Decoration Extravaganza! Join Chef Sophia Dickmyer to learn how to turn cookies into beautiful holiday treats. You’ll master piping designs\, adding decorations\, and creating festive cookies. This hands-on class will inspire you to make every cookie a holiday masterpiece! \nHands on. Ages 12 and up.  \n\nRoyal Icing\nClassic Sugar Cookie Cutouts (fun sized and giant 8 inch cutters in various patterns)\nDecorating how to’s and tips\, including piping and flooding consistencies
