SUMMARY:2840 - Croquembouche Party!
DESCRIPTION:Join Pastry Chef Joseph Renfroe to learn the art of creating elegant cream puff towers. In this hands-on class\, you’ll make delicate choux pastry\, fill it with pastry cream\, and assemble your tower with caramel or chocolate. Finish with festive decorations like powdered sugar\, cranberries\, and spun sugar for a show-stopping dessert centerpiece. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up.  \n\nChoux pastry puffs\nPastry cream filling\nCream puff tower assembly with caramel or chocolate\nDecorating with powdered sugar\, cranberries\, and spun sugar
